       "value": "A well-kept roll of tools left out on the bench, which on this ship is practically an invitation."
      },
      {
       "name": "use",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "I borrow the tool roll from the bench."
      },
      {
       "name": "mark",
       "type": "string",
       "value": "t"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
